  "text": "Silver Price in the 2000s\nBetween the first (2000-01-31) and last (2009-12-31) monthly observations available for the 2000s, the LBMA silver price went from $5.26 to $16.99 — a gain of 223% — with a sampled high of $19.62 (Feb 2008) and a sampled low of $4.14 (Nov 2001).\nYears in the 2000s\n2000\n2001\n2002\n2003\n2004\n2005\n2006\n2007\n2008\n2009\nSee today's live silver price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop silver bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
